      "in_diff": true,
      "id": "51713-restore-wait-observation",
      "body": "### Restore the wait result's observation\n\n**Severity:** `medium`\n\n`WaitForStable` returns a `StableWaitResult<ProcessWindow>`, not a `ProcessWindow`. It has no `WindowHandle` and cannot be returned as `ProcessWindow`, so `MouseUtils.UITests.Next` fails to compile. Use the successful wait's `LastObservation` for the handle and return value:\n\n```suggestion\n                WindowControl.WaitForForeground(preview.LastObservation.Hwnd, 2_000);\n                return preview.LastObservation;\n```",
